WEBVTT

00:02:25.579 --> 00:02:32.121
No, I wasn't sure. So it's really
interesting that you've you've never

00:02:32.121 --> 00:02:35.829
worked this hard before. Does that mean
you're you're adapting well to remote

00:02:35.829 --> 00:02:39.079
work and being sort of in
one place in an office?

00:02:39.538 --> 00:02:41.579
Well, it's not an office.
It's up in my room.

00:02:41.579 --> 00:02:44.204
It's a little area and it's very small.

00:02:44.496 --> 00:02:49.913
And so my my little studio is sitting
on a very hard stool.

00:02:50.246 --> 00:02:54.246
But, you know, I'm happy.
What I miss, I mean,

00:02:54.246 --> 00:02:57.163
I was travelling 300 days
a year around the world,

00:02:57.371 --> 00:03:01.204
and you would think that was harder
work and it surely was sometimes